    "glucose_gate": {
      "description": "Per-agent glucose gate (zero-delay relay): glycoATP = local Glucose > the 4 mM Glucose_supply threshold owned by the Associations table; mitoATP OFF. Below threshold the cell is a quiescent non-consumer. Necrotic cells are skipped. No proliferation node.",
      "enabled": true,
